{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24268","headline":"和刘汝州酬侍中见寄长句因书集贤坊胜事戏而问之 · 白居易","name":"和刘汝州酬侍中见寄长句因书集贤坊胜事戏而问之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛川汝海封畿接，履道集贤来往频。\n一复时程虽不远，百余步地更相亲。\n朱门陪宴多投辖，青眼留欢任吐茵。\n闻道郡斋还有酒，花前月下对何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}